27056      title 'Gasoline and Emissions Data';
27057      data gas;
27058      set sashelp.gas;
27059      if fuel in ('Ethanol', '82rongas', 'Gasohol');
27060      run;

NOTE: There were 171 observations read from the data set SASHELP.GAS.
NOTE: The data set WORK.GAS has 112 observations and 4 variables.

27061      ods graphics on;
27062      * Request a Spline Transformation of Equivalence Ratio;
27063      proc transreg data=Gas solve ss2 plots=(transformation obp residuals);
27064      model identity(nox) = spline(EqRatio / nknots=4);
27065      run;

NOTE: 2 observations were deleted from the analysis due to missing values.
NOTE: Algorithm converged.
NOTE: There were 112 observations read from the data set WORK.GAS.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE TRANSREG printed page 1657.

27066      * Separate Curves and Intercepts;
27067      proc transreg data=Gas solve ss2 additive plots=(transformation obp);
27068      model identity(nox) = class(Fuel / zero=none) |
27069      spline(EqRatio / nknots=4 after);
27070      run;

NOTE: Since the model contains SMOOTH, BSPLINE, PBSPLINE, or a CLASS expansion with ZERO=NONE, a model with an implicit intercept is fit.
NOTE: All statistics are mean corrected.
NOTE: 2 observations were deleted from the analysis due to missing values.
NOTE: Algorithm converged.
NOTE: There were 112 observations read from the data set WORK.GAS.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE TRANSREG printed page 1658.

27071      * Separate Intercepts;
27072      proc transreg data=Gas solve ss2 additive;
27073      model identity(nox) = class(Fuel / zero=none)
27074      spline(EqRatio / nknots=4);
27075      run;

NOTE: Since the model contains SMOOTH, BSPLINE, PBSPLINE, or a CLASS expansion with ZERO=NONE, a model with an implicit intercept is fit.
NOTE: All statistics are mean corrected.
