27080      title 'Introductory Main-Effects ANOVA Example';
27081      data a;
27082      input y x1 $ x2 $;
27083      datalines;

NOTE: The data set WORK.A has 12 observations and 3 variables.

27096      ;
27097      * Fit a main-effects ANOVA model with 1, 0, -1 coding;
27098      proc transreg ss2;
27099      model identity(y) = class(x1 x2 / effects);
27100      output coefficients replace;
27101      run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.DATA28 has 14 observations and 9 variables.
